  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: a014e981164b34ef4b183cb579b7e688, type: 3}
  m_Name: 01_KeepersNote
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: TheLightenRoad.Codex::TheLightenRoad.Codex.ArchiveLog
  Id: keepers-note
  Title: The Keeper's Last Shift
  Text: 'The lower office has gone quiet. We left our lamps burning, certain someone
    would return to collect them.


    I recorded the shelves'' circuit before the
    last bell. Power gives the archive motion. Without it, even the heaviest shelf
    becomes a place to stand.'
  RoomClue: Drain a moving shelf's vein to freeze it at its current position. Recover
    your ember before leaving.
  Audio: {fileID: 0}
